{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Poua</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus made cute and simple. Poua lives on your desktop as a friendly companion that keeps you in the zone. It watches your cursor, helps you remember what matters, and celebrates your wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The power of a gaze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poua looks your cursor. This is an intentional cue grounded in the &quot;observer effect&quot;, the tendency for people to adjust behavior when they feel observed. That subtle sense of being watched can nudge you back on task and help reduce distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hear your goal, stay on track</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a session begins or your attention drifts, Poua can speak your preset goal and show it on screen. You control the frequency, and you can turn it on or off at any time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Celebrate your progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points for dedicated focus and unlock surprise hat boxes. Dress up Poua with the hats you discover, and turn consistent effort into cheerful rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with Your Past Self</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yesterday's you by racing against your own focus records. To deepen the immersion, you can revisit your past goals and even see the hats your past self was wearing. It's a friendly rivalry that keeps you motivated to stay consistent and outdo yourself day after day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=306 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/46061ab7900e34b414621124ce8048d5.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=306 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/46061ab7900e34b414621124ce8048d5.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/46061ab7900e34b414621124ce8048d5.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep tabs on your focus journey with clear weekly and monthly statistics. Review your focus time, and consistency patterns to see how far you've come. These insights help you spot trends, celebrate milestones, and adjust your routine for better results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/31242dccc4d32046840d9597de4f0ab8.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/31242dccc4d32046840d9597de4f0ab8.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/31242dccc4d32046840d9597de4f0ab8.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture your thoughts without breaking focus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poua's note feature lets you jot down ideas instantly without leaving your flow.<br>It supports Markdown, Outliner structure, and quick reordering with Alt + Arrow keys.<br>Adjust transparency to keep your workspace clear and focused.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A solid Pomodoro timer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set flexible session lengths down to the minute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize Focus, Short Break, and Long Break durations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see clear visual progress and optionally show remaining time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pause and resume sessions effortlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run seamless automatic repeat cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep the widget always on top for quick glanceability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust size and position to fit your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to its transparent background, it stays out of your way while you work.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Still the Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906800/c066ffc689c45775e482f153c053a844a3090d34.jpg"},{"name":"The Focused Type","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906800/3b84cb12fa736d5d80b8261dba3f168e4247e6fd.jpg"},{"name":"Human or Timer?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906800/6868ccbfdfa931b8ad33f947efa563b49ff8ab8b.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906800?t=1765175822","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906800?t=1765175822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/cc780ed226cba04e5336d31978016d56d3d0ab3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765175822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/cc780ed226cba04e5336d31978016d56d3d0ab3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765175822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4049950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Poua</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus made cute and simple. Poua lives on your desktop as a friendly companion that keeps you in the zone. It watches your cursor, helps you remember what matters, and celebrates your wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The power of a gaze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/a1eef4af64a2c1f36707f5d942951fa8.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poua looks your cursor. This is an intentional cue grounded in the &quot;observer effect&quot;, the tendency for people to adjust behavior when they feel observed. That subtle sense of being watched can nudge you back on task and help reduce distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hear your goal, stay on track</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/81012b5a5b06693aa5b41a0c20cc5c9b.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a session begins or your attention drifts, Poua can speak your preset goal and show it on screen. You control the frequency, and you can turn it on or off at any time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Celebrate your progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/c7e3be6a679ac0b3e1389462a4f26e61.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points for dedicated focus and unlock surprise hat boxes. Dress up Poua with the hats you discover, and turn consistent effort into cheerful rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with Your Past Self</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=616 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/1fa17d65df45e8d23ed90f74ea675ad9.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yesterday's you by racing against your own focus records. To deepen the immersion, you can revisit your past goals and even see the hats your past self was wearing. It's a friendly rivalry that keeps you motivated to stay consistent and outdo yourself day after day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.poster.avif?t=1765175822\" width=306 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.webm?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906800/extras/051fd7b846f895eaacc2ca9e0ee7ca05.mp4?t=1765175822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share